{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1333091-sharing-nostalgia","id":1333091,"title":"Sharing Nostalgia","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-08-29T05:43:20-07:00","id":1333091,"title":"Sharing Nostalgia","content":"Super random topic, I apologize. But, I recently came across a relic from my college years, while cleaning house. An untitled sketchbook with the cover painted in swirls of white and silver as if to evoke mist. I once did an honors project for the art class I was taking at the time that involved picking multiple short stories and providing illustrations for them. <br /> <br /> \u201cWhat does this have to do with C:tD?\u201d You may be asking yourself. Two of the stories I did drawings for were <i>The Tooth Fairy</i> from the <b>Inanimae</b> book and <i>Lion and the Heart of Wonder</i> from the <b>Pooka</b> kithbook. And looking over the sketchbook filled me with a massive amount of nostalgia and I just wanted to share. <br /> <br /> When I have some free time, I may attempt to take photos of my doodles and share them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thread Reaper <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">\uff1c(\u00b4 \u055e)\u0a0a( \u055e )\uff1e\ufeff</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/377-xanandithras","name":"Xanandithras","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar377_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"427"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-05T14:15:11-08:00","id":1365610,"title":"","content":"That\u2019s great! It\u2019s so nice that your a artist.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-05T15:16:59-08:00","id":1365618,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xanandithras</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1333091-sharing-nostalgia#post1333091\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Super random topic, I apologize. But, I recently came across a relic from my college years, while cleaning house. An untitled sketchbook with the cover painted in swirls of white and silver as if to evoke mist. I once did an honors project for the art class I was taking at the time that involved picking multiple short stories and providing illustrations for them.<br /> <br /> \u201cWhat does this have to do with C:tD?\u201d You may be asking yourself. Two of the stories I did drawings for were <i>The Tooth Fairy</i> from the <b>Inanimae</b> book and <i>Lion and the Heart of Wonder</i> from the <b>Pooka</b> kithbook. And looking over the sketchbook filled me with a massive amount of nostalgia and I just wanted to share.<br /> <br /> When I have some free time, I may attempt to take photos of my doodles and share them.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would be delighted to see these illustrations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/2504943\" target=\"_blank\">The Big Over Easy</a></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","name":"MythAdvocate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-05T15:20:40-08:00","id":1365620,"title":"","content":"I always felt this forum needed more artists displaying their projects. I love changelings ascetics so I'm interested.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}